{
    "_comment": "Hal - radio operator in the Tundra (prefab radio_hut). Talks in radio jargon ('Copy', 'Over'). Quest 'hal': fix the 3 antennas (antenna_1/2/3 dialogues, minigame 'wires'); counter 'hal_antennas'. When all three work, channel nine plays 'We need to turn it off.' (horror lines) -> Cassette Tape. Reward at the end: the Cassette Tape OR the Flare Gun (player's choice).",
    "partner": "hal",
    "start": [
        {
            "if": {
                "quest_done": "hal"
            },
            "goto": "after"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "quest": "hal",
                "counter_at_least": [
                    "hal_antennas",
                    3
                ]
            },
            "goto": "finale"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "quest": "hal",
                "counter_at_least": [
                    "hal_antennas",
                    2
                ]
            },
            "goto": "progress2"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "quest": "hal",
                "counter_at_least": [
                    "hal_antennas",
                    1
                ]
            },
            "goto": "progress1"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "quest": "hal"
            },
            "goto": "progress0"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "flag": "talked:hal"
            },
            "goto": "again"
        },
        "first"
    ],
    "nodes": {
        "first": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "talked:hal"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "pointing",
                    "text": "Contact! Hold position, stranger. Don't touch the dials."
                },
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Name's Hal. Radio operator, Silverpine Tundra station. Only station. Only operator. Over."
                },
                {
                    "who": "player",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Over?"
                },
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Habit. Thirty years on the radio does that. You stop saying 'goodbye' and start saying 'over'."
                },
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "Not much traffic lately. Three antennas out there, all three dead. Frost gets in the boxes. Monsters chew the wires. Mostly the frost."
                },
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "tired",
                    "text": "Without them I'm listening to snow. Static, static, static. Over."
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "I can fix them.",
                    "goto": "accept"
                },
                {
                    "text": "What are you listening for?",
                    "goto": "listening"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Not my problem.",
                    "goto": "no"
                }
            ]
        },
        "listening": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "Anything. Everything. A voice, a song, a weather report from somewhere warm."
                },
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "...There used to be something on channel nine. Late at night. I never caught all of it."
                },
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Get the antennas back up and maybe I will. So. Can I count on you?"
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "I'll fix them.",
                    "goto": "accept"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Not now.",
                    "goto": "no"
                }
            ]
        },
        "no": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Copy. The offer stays on the frequency. Over and out."
                }
            ]
        },
        "accept": {
            "do": {
                "quest": {
                    "start": "hal"
                }
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Copy that! Three antennas, scattered around the Tundra. You'll know them. Tall, metal, sad-looking."
                },
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "pointing",
                    "text": "Open the box at the bottom, match the wires by colour. Red to red, blue to blue. Even a penguin could do it."
                },
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Not that we have penguins. Report back when all three are humming. Over."
                }
            ]
        },
        "again": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Back on the frequency, stranger? The antennas are still dead. Want the job?"
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "I'll fix them.",
                    "goto": "accept"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Not now.",
                    "goto": "no"
                }
            ]
        },
        "progress0": {
            "random_line": true,
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "tired",
                    "text": "Nothing yet. Static. Pure, high-quality static. Over."
                },
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "The antennas won't fix themselves, stranger. I asked them. Twice."
                }
            ]
        },
        "progress1": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "One antenna up! I can hear the wind on a whole new frequency. Two to go. Over."
                }
            ]
        },
        "progress2": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "Two up. There's something between the static now. Can't make it out. One more, stranger."
                },
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "...Hurry. Please. Over."
                }
            ]
        },
        "finale": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "happy",
                    "text": "All three! I can hear everything. The whole Tundra, loud and clear."
                },
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "Listen. Channel nine. Here it comes..."
                },
                {
                    "who": "radio",
                    "pose": "static",
                    "horror": true,
                    "speed": 0.5,
                    "text": "...need to... turn it off."
                },
                {
                    "who": "radio",
                    "pose": "static",
                    "horror": true,
                    "speed": 0.5,
                    "text": "We need to turn it off."
                },
                {
                    "who": "radio",
                    "pose": "static",
                    "horror": true,
                    "speed": 0.5,
                    "text": "We need to turn it off. We need to turn it off. We need to"
                },
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "scared",
                    "text": "...That's it. That's all it says. Over and over."
                },
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "scared",
                    "text": "I heard it before. Years ago. Never this clear."
                },
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "Who needs to turn what off? ...No. Don't answer that. I have a feeling I really don't want to know."
                },
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "pointing",
                    "text": "I recorded it. Take the tape and get it away from my radio."
                },
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Or, if you'd rather not carry that thing around... take my old flare gun instead. Can't have both. Over."
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "I'll take the tape.",
                    "goto": "reward"
                },
                {
                    "text": "I'll take the flare gun.",
                    "goto": "reward_flare"
                }
            ]
        },
        "reward": {
            "do": {
                "give": "Cassette Tape",
                "quest": {
                    "finish": "hal"
                }
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Thanks for the antennas, stranger. I mean it. From now on I'm sticking to the weather channel. Over and out."
                }
            ]
        },
        "after": {
            "random_line": true,
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Weather report: cold. Tomorrow: colder. Over."
                },
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "Channel nine's quiet now. I keep it switched off. Mostly."
                },
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "tired",
                    "text": "You still have that tape? Don't play it near me. Over.",
                    "if": {
                        "item": "Cassette Tape"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "The antennas are holding. Good work, stranger. Over."
                }
            ]
        },
        "reward_flare": {
            "do": {
                "give": "Flare Gun",
                "quest": {
                    "finish": "hal"
                }
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "hal",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Good choice. Some things are better left unheard. Thanks for the antennas, stranger. Over and out."
                }
            ]
        }
    }
}
